## Scope Contract 2: URL Resolution Fix - Proper Slug Generation

**Goal**: Fix navigation links to generate correct URLs with full path slugs

### Current State
```typescript
// catalogue-nav.utils.ts
const transformedItem = {
  id: item.slug?.current || item.title.toLowerCase().replace(/\s+/g, '-'),
  sections: (item.children || []).map((child: any) => ({
    links: (child.children || []).map((link: any) => link.title) // ❌ Just titles!
  })),
};
```
- Navigation shows product titles ("Open-Back") instead of clickable URLs
- Links lose parent path context ("/shop/open-back" vs just "open-back")
- User cannot navigate to category pages from mega-menu

### Target State
```typescript
// Navigation link generates full URL
{
  label: "Open-Back",
  url: "/products/headphones/open-back", // ✅ Full path
  slug: "open-back"
}
```
- Navigation links point to correct `/products/[...category]` routes
- URLs include full path context for breadcrumbs
- Clicking "Open-Back" navigates to `/products/headphones/open-back`

### Implementation
1. **Update Navigation Data Transformation**:
   - In `data/catalogue.ts`, add path-aware transformation
   - Build full URL paths from VFS breadcrumbs data
   - Maintain parent→child relationship for URL construction

2. **Update Navigation Components**:
   - Modify `CatalogueView.tsx` to accept URL prop
   - Ensure all link items are actual `<a>` tags or Next.js `<Link>`
   - Preserve existing visual styling

3. **Update Drawer Navigation**:
   - Apply same URL generation to `CarouselCatalogue`
   - Ensure mobile drawer links work identically to desktop

### DoD - Verification Checklist
- [ ] Hovering "Headphones" mega-menu shows clickable "Open-Back" link
- [ ] Clicking "Open-Back" navigates to `/products/headphones/open-back`
- [ ] URL pattern: `/products/{root}/{parent?}/{leaf}`
- [ ] Mobile drawer links function identically to desktop
- [ ] All 20 leaf categories have working navigation links

### Testing
```typescript
// Manual verification
// 1. Start dev server
// 2. Hover "Headphones" in navbar
// 3. Verify "By Design" section shows "Open-Back" as clickable link
// 4. Click link, verify navigation to /products/headphones/open-back
// 5. Repeat for all leaf categories

// Automated link validation
node scripts/verify-navigation-links.mjs
// Expected: All 20 leaf nodes return 200 OK
```

